*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0009
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-04-17 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 133
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0009.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 CREDIT-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
    05 ANN-INCOME         PIC 9(7)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 APPROVED-LIMIT     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM ASSIGN-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "APPROVED-LIMIT=" APPROVED-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
ASSIGN-LIMIT.
    IF CREDIT-SCORE GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 760
        COMPUTE APPROVED-LIMIT = ANN-INCOME * 0.30
    ELSE
        *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
        IF CREDIT-SCORE GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 680
            COMPUTE APPROVED-LIMIT = ANN-INCOME * 0.15
        ELSE
            MOVE 1000.00 TO APPROVED-LIMIT
        END-IF
    END-IF.
